elon is probably one of the most  influential men in the world but his  family history remains an enigma for  many of my viewers so i thought i'd take  the time to introduce you to his father  errol musk and why elon claims he is one  of the most evil people he has ever met  so stick around this video will give you  quite an insight into the life of our  favorite billionaire family history we  have seen countless pictures of elon and  his siblings with their mum mae musk but  we never see any with their father this  is because the relationship of the musk  siblings with their father errol is  complicated to say the least errol was  born in pretoria south africa in 1946 to  an army sergeant father and a british  mother he would grow up to become a very  successful electro-mechanical engineer a  trait he undoubtedly passed along to his  son elon errol grew up in the same  neighborhood as may and the pair dated  on and off in university may would go on  to become a supermodel and a dietitian  she later told elon's biographer ashley  vance that errol relentlessly pursued  her hand in marriage and he would never  stop proposing to her the couple finally  married in 1970. this is another trait  that errol passed along to his son elon  also pursued his first wife justine  similarly while at university in canada  justine recounted how elon would call  her insistently and would not take no  for an answer she even said to elon's  biographer you can't blow him off i do  think of him as the terminator he locks  his gaze onto something and says it  shall be mine bit by bit he won me over  nine months after errol and may tied the  knot elon came into the world in 1971.  the family's early years were happy  enough they had kimball the following  year and elon's sister tosca came along  in 1974. eril and may realized very  early on that elon was different as  errol told south african radio station  702's money show with bruce whitfield  elon has always been a very deep thinker  when he was very small around three or  four years old he would ask questions  like where is the whole world this set  him apart from other kids his age in  those days the musk family had a  comfortable life in pretoria along with  his engineering business errol had also  become a successful real estate  developer according to elon errol was a  very talented engineer with an extremely  high iq although he never accepted it  errol greatly influenced elon's bent  towards engineering and he benefited  immensely from his father's skills errol  has mentioned on many occasions that he  took young elon to his engineering work  sites where he got hands-on experience  laying bricks plumbing and electrical  wiring he was also the one who  introduced elon to the world of  computers and programming when elon was  11 years old he insisted errol take him  to a computer programming lecture at the  university of the witwatersrand  johannesburg although he was too young  for the lecture errol used his  engineering connections to get him in  errol later recounted the story in the  same interview with bruce whitfield he  had dropped off elon for the lecture and  when he came back after three hours to  get him he waited and waited but elon  wouldn't come out of the lecture hall he  finally stepped inside to see what was  going on and witnessed that everyone had  left but elon with his sleeves rolled up  was deep in conversation with the  lecturers they were so impressed with  his enthusiasm and knowledge that they  forced errol to buy him his first laptop  and that's how elon's love affair with  computer programming began this love for  programming would make him his first  million when he and his brother kimball  sold their first company zip 2 to  compact in 1999. incidentally the  brothers borrowed the funds required to  start this company from errol so far you  must be thinking that it sounds like  elon had an extremely happy childhood  which he spent with a very supportive  father so why does he call him evil well  the cracks began to appear when errol  and may divorced in 1979 when elon was  only 8 years old cracks in the musk  family although from the outside it may  have appeared that elon had a happy  childhood in his words it was full of  misery thanks mainly to errol and his  behavior towards may after their divorce  when they divorced the couple had only  been married for nine years mae later  described it as leaving an emotionally  and physically abusive relationship  after the divorce mei and the children  had to change their lifestyles  drastically the comfortable lavish  existence under their father's wealth  was suddenly gone and mae struggled for  a long time as a single mother to make  ends meet the divorce was not amicable  and may had to work several jobs to  support her three children she told an  interviewer that she had to buy them  second-hand clothes and find the  cheapest ingredients in the store to  cook the meals because she had no money  she also recollected that this one time  she cried when one of the children  spilled milk on the floor as she had no  more money to buy them more this  undoubtedly caused elon a lot of trauma  and resentment against his father  despite that in 1981 he decided to move  in with his father to a suburb of  johannesburg it would be a decision that  he would later come to regret the next  eight years spent with errol would shape  not only his world views but also his  views of him as an evil man elon later  revealed to rolling stone in an  interview in 2017 that his father was a  terrible human being he said my dad will  have a carefully thought out plan of  evil he will plan evil although he never  gave any specifics as to why he  considered errol to be evil he went on  to say that people have no idea how bad  errol was and how he has committed  almost every crime possible after  listening to this interview it's hard  not to imagine that his father must have  done something terrible in those days  that led elon to formulate such a strong  opinion of him and since elon claims it  was not physical violence it must have  been something external that left a deep  emotional scar in young elon's mind  errol's questionable past although elon  stopped himself from giving further  details in that interview this is what i  know from my own research errol has  confessed to shooting and killing three  people who broke into his home he was  later cleared of any wrongdoings but it  takes a different kind of man to pull  off something like that even if it is in  self-defense the man also has a child  with his step-daughter from a different  marriage jaina bizadenhout jaina's mum  married aryl when she was only four  years old and she grew up with him as  the major father figure in her life her  mum later divorced him but she  maintained contact with him their paths  crossed in 2017 which led to the birth  of a son in 2018. errol claimed that  jaina turned to him for comfort after a  breakup with her boyfriend and the child  was conceived in the heat of the moment  this incident was a huge embarrassment  for the musk family and further  indicated the man's moral state errell  has also claimed in multiple business  insider articles that he owned part of  an emerald mine in zambia which made him  so rich that he couldn't even close his  safe with all the money he was making  however elon refuted this claim in a  tweet saying that errol didn't own an  emerald mine and that he had to work his  way through college ending up with over  a hundred thousand dollars in student  debt whatever may be the truth one thing  is for sure there is no love lost  between elon and his father errol for  his part has not been silent on the  matter either in a 2018 interview with  the daily mail he said elon needs to  grow up and that he's having a tantrum  like a spoiled child anyways after  living with his father for eight years  elon left for canada in 1989. a few  months later may also moved to canada  with tosca so elon kimball mae and tosca  all lived for a while in toronto elon  then transferred to the university of  pennsylvania where he graduated in 1997  with a bachelor of arts degree in  physics and a bachelor of science degree  in economics from the wharton school  according to elon his father did not  approve of him moving to canada in fact  errol didn't think that his son would  make much of himself and that he would  be back in south africa within three  months not only did he not ever go back  to south africa but he also went on to  make himself the richest person in the  world founding two of the most  successful and innovative companies in  the world spacex and tesla i think  elon's drive to save humanity and his  aggressive push against the established  system of the world stems from his  childhood pain the key to his worldview  can be found somewhere in this deep  trauma bond that he shares with his  father what do you think am i right and  assuming that elon's goal to save  humanity is rooted in the complicated  relationship he shares with his father  let me know down in the comment section  below if you enjoyed this video  subscribe to the channel and don't  forget to hit the like button see you in  the next one

